	"Contest, weren't you?\l"
	"It's easy to tell from your Pok\emon.\p"
	"I'm a reporter. I'm working on a story\n"
	"on Pok\emon ContestS.\p"
	"If I may, would you be willing to answer\n"
	"a few questions?"
}
text(local) LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_DescribeContest{
	"Oh, you will?\n"
	"Thank you.\p"
	"Briefly, how would you describe the\n"
	"Contest you just entered?"
}
