	"quite the charmer in Pok\emon ContestS."
}
text gTVNameRaterText09{
	"The nickname {STR_VAR_1} is rooted by\n"
	"the letter \qo{STR_VAR_3}.\qc\p"
	"That letter is supported by the first\n"
	"letter \qo{STR_VAR_2},\qc which gives it a solid sense\l"
