}
text gTVNameRaterText10{
	"The nickname {STR_VAR_1} is very\n"
	"shapely in a pleasing manner.\p"
	"The presence of the letters \qo{STR_VAR_2}\qc and\n"
	"\qo{STR_VAR_3}\qc--now that is remarkably good!"
}
text gTVNameRaterText11{
	"The nickname {STR_VAR_1}--it has a\n"
